When enabling private endpoints for your containers, you need to trust this CA to establish HTTPS connections to them.

USAGE:
  scw container container get-private-endpoint-ca [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  [region=fr-par]   Region to target. If none is passed will use default region from the config (fr-par | nl-ams | pl-waw | it-mil)

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for get-private-endpoint-ca
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
